], "orientation_identifiability": "Upright axis identifiable; azimuth is symmetry-ambiguous."}\n  ],\n  "evaluator_only_evidence": ["Object inventories, extracted material states, instance statistics, overlap candidates and source-only reproduction are independent evaluator products, not student actions. Source-only regeneration succeeded without the external capability library and independently reproduced a pixel-identical 640x360 image; this is reproducibility evidence, not proof of student verification or scene fidelity. Evidence: /evidence/independent_evaluation/source_only/reproduction.json:1-42; /evidence/independent_evaluation/image_comparison.json:14-30; /evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/summary.json:1-16.", "Common-light images are evaluator-only auxiliary products; they were not inspected for this annotation and no comparative claim is made. Evidence: /app/input_index.json:24-29."],\n  "unsupported_or_unknown_claims": ["No inferred causal library benefit, hidden reasoning, numerical aligned 3D error, or physically verified support/contact. No claim of student visual comparison or iterative improvement is supported by the SDK trace. Evidence: /evidence/sdk_events.json:1-138; /evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/summary.json:8-15."],\n  "limitations": ["Semantic correspondences are automated model proposals, not manually verified or deterministic mask matches. Repeated chairs and desks are deliberately not individually mapped because assembly membership and one-to-one identities were not sufficiently established. Evidence: /evidence/reference_gt/reference_instance_statistics.json:306-464,617-767; /evidence/final_source/build.py:46-76.", "Inventory projected bounds are unclipped bounding boxes, not visible-mask centroids, and GT and student transforms do not establish a shared coordinate frame or scale. One image leaves hidden surfaces, exact dimensions and symmetric orientations uncertain. Evidence: /evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/summary.json:10-15; /app/input_index.json:33; /evidence/reference_gt/reference_instance_statistics.json:978."],\n  "human_rating": null\n}', 'numLines': 64, 'startLine': 1, 'totalLines': 64}}, 'origin': None}
