om mesh geometry.", "The reference mirror contains a reflected white cabinet; the student places the Reflected upper cabinet and inset meshes directly in front of Mirror (/evidence/final_source/build.py:59-67). The countertop uses separate thin Marble vein meshes (lines 73-78), not a marble texture. Own lights and world are specified at lines 81-85; unique albedo/lighting decomposition is not identifiable.", "Original-scene extraction reports no missing external images (/evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/summary.json:2-7). No full-reference image-plane replacement is supported by the executed source; packed-resource status has not been separately established."],\n52\t  "geometry_analysis": ["The scene contains 752 meshes and 755 total objects in the independent original-scene summary; 293 AABB overlap candidates are coarse candidates, not verified collisions or repairs (/evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/summary.json:2-15).", "The range and shelf are multipart box/cylinder constructions; the foreground slab has no modeled support and the leaf has no modeled pivot (/evidence/final_source/build.py:31-58,68-80). These observations do not establish intended hidden GT geometry or actual surface contact."],\n53\t  "semantic_correspondence": [\n54\t    {"gt_instance_ids": [23], "gt_semantic_label": "dishwasher", "student_object_names": ["Freestanding left oven", "Left oven front glass", "Left oven handle"], "confidence": "medium", "basis": ["/evidence/reference_gt/reference_instance_statistics.json:90-112 identifies visible GT instance 23; /evidence/reference_gt/objects_in_view.json:29-35 labels it dishwasher.", "/evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/object_inventory.jsonl:716 and /evidence/final_source/build.py:46-50 identify the student\'s left appliance and its front pieces; image locations correspond."], "ambiguity": ["Student interpreted the appliance as an oven; rack