citation or substantive corresponding network establishes reimplementation."},\n    {"unit": "support and connectivity screening", "module": "available_library/methods.py", "function": "support_samples, bounds_separation", "provenance_category": "unknown", "phases": {"read": "initial documentation only", "written": false, "executed": false, "verified": false, "retained": false}, "actual_call_evidence": ["student_initial_prompt.txt:36-37", "final_source/build.py:57-95", "sdk_events.json events 0-4"], "modified_or_inlined": false, "observed_outcome": "Chair and desk pieces were placed by construction, without recorded support ray casts or connectivity tests.", "attribution_uncertainty": "Placement of furniture on a floor does not establish adoption of the screening method."}\n  ],\n  "nonuse": ["No later library read, module import, actual library call, or explicitly cited reimplementation appears in sdk_events.json events 0-4 or final_source/build.py:1-104. Initial documentation was supplied nevertheless.", "No student-render inspection, comparison, overhead view, landmark score, support check, or revision is recorded; sdk_events.json events 0-4."],\n  "methods_actually_executed": ["SDK event 0 Write call-2f193fc147ea481b81576e04d39cefe0 wrote build.py; event 1 Bash call-f896a4105f5b4661b22a93d343b25655 ran Blender, with success log in event 3 and executions/blender_1795841919337226284/stdout.log:1-5.", "executions/blender_1795841919337226284/code/build.py:6-104 constructs flat Principled materials, room and curve wallpaper, window, two rows of desks, eight chairs, two lamps, lights and camera; saves the scene and renders. Original inventory confirms the resulting named objects."],\n  "student_verification": ["The student received the Blender success log, not an image tool result; event 3 reports final.png and scene.blend saved, and event 4 delivers links. No visual comparison or iterative verification appears in sdk_events.json:1-137.", "The delivered final image is