vents.json:1-135."],\n24\t  "methods_actually_executed": ["The student checked Blender version, then wrote and ran build.py once using Blender background mode. Event 0 call-d2aa357d644a4ae19caeb7acdc8f6734; event 2 call-1a1311e1cf9143e78d242639b4d07d36; /evidence/evidence_index.json:119-167.", "The executed source uses primitive boxes and cylinders, bevels, repeated shelf and seam geometry, a manually profiled chair with solidify and subdivision modifiers, point and area lights, and a perspective camera; Cycles rendered at 640 x 360. /evidence/executions/blender_1795842012784223468/code/build.py:6-99; /evidence/final_source/render.log:1-7."],\n25\t  "student_verification": ["The version command returned Blender 5.2.2 and the build tool completed without output because its output was redirected; the trace has no subsequent log read, scene inspection, image display, comparison, or revision. /evidence/sdk_events.json:3-53,56-116.", "Saved render and scene are supported by the execution capture and log, not by a recorded student visual review. /evidence/evidence_index.json:139-167; /evidence/final_source/render.log:1-7."],\n26\t  "failures_and_recovery": ["The build log reports a Material.use_nodes deprecation warning, not a traceback; the captured build exit code is zero and traceback list is empty. No recovery or iterative edit is recorded. /evidence/final_source/render.log:1-7; /evidence/evidence_index.json:139-167.", "All three deliverables are recorded present and the SDK completed normally; no actual SDK or bridge failure is shown in the student trace. /app/input_index.json:8-16; /evidence/evidence_index.json:29-36,43-45,53-60,104-109; /evidence/sdk_events.json:110-135."],\n27\t  "side_effects": ["build.py clears the initial Blender objects and writes /app/scene.blend and /app/final.png; the shell redirects output to /app/render.log. This concerns the student\'s own build workspace, not an evaluator repair. /evidence/final_source/build.py:4,98-99; /evidence/sdk_ev